as orbitronics.
It is worth noting that these ⃗k-space OAM textures
closely mirror their SAM counterparts. For example, the
helical OAM texture exhibiting orbital-momentum locking is analogous to the spin-momentum locking with helical SAM texture, while the radial OAM texture finds
its analogue in the radial SAM texture [14, 16, 20, 21].
