heated in a two-zone furnace, with the cold and hot zones
maintained 400 ◦ C and 520 ◦ C, respectively. After one
week, needle-like (TaSe4 )2 I single crystals, a few milimeters in size, were obtained. The stoichiometry of the synthesized crystals was confirmed using Energy-dispersive
